BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:f4e641d68754c4164edc89ac@greenville-kid-calendar
DTSTAMP:20260925T151443Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260926T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260926T120000
SUMMARY:Wildlife Geeks Animal Presentation
LOCATION:TCMU Greenville\, 300 College St\, Greenville\, SC\, 29601
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for a wild adventure with Wildlife Geeks! This intera
 ctive animal presentation brings guests face-to-face with incredible creat
 ures while learning fun facts about habitats\, adaptations\, and conservat
 ion. Wildlife Geeks combines education\, excitement\, and hands-on engagem
 ent for an unforgettable experience perfect for curious kids and animal lo
 vers of all ages. This is included with museum admission. Source: The Chil
 dren's Museum of the Upstate. Check the linked organizer page before leavi
 ng.
URL:https://tcmupstate.org/event/wildlife-geeks-animal-presentation-2/
END:VEVENT
